  "product_context": "KEYSTONE is a high-performance database indexing and lookup engine built for precise, repeatable retrieval over sorted 64-bit integer datasets. It combines anchor-guided interpolation search, adaptive backend selection, SIMD-assisted local scans, OpenMP parallelism, an optional Fortran batch engine, and compressed archive ingestion. Integration layers tailor this for telemetry and security event processing (DSMIL).",
